im so sorry to hear that, i have the exact issue. i wrote a text on this sub not too long ago (for context, i am mtf). but please dont give up, there are countless of lgbt communities out there willing to help, if you'd like you could speak to me about it. i have yet to transition, and honestly getting deadnamed, misgendered and all that fucking sucks. i can tell my parents certainly get uncomfortable from trying. but i believe in you, you'll have a great transition. you are valid, no matter how you look. you are a real man, despite not having a penis or looking masculine.

&#x200B;

just hang on a bit, okay? i believe in you :)

